{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q046","title":"46. 回到原圖：纖毛柱狀上皮與影像判讀限制","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"9fe23dee179590797431ae00e753228eb99a34d6389b8dcf2ddfa85115d5d7f4","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_bcf1a2ae00f881918c75b83e54cc2213","sourceAnchor":"q46","shortHtml":"<p>官方試卷附圖之放大擷取版，694×862 像素；內容與官方試卷附圖相符，放大不會新增組織細節。</p>","html":"<div><h2>46. 回到原圖：纖毛柱狀上皮與影像判讀限制</h2><figure><figcaption><strong>第 46 題官方原題附圖</strong><p>官方試卷附圖之放大擷取版，694×862 像素；內容與官方試卷附圖相符，放大不會新增組織細節。</p></figcaption><details><summary>切換此擷取檔的像素尺寸（可橫向捲動）</summary><p>此為題卷附圖的放大擷取版；放大不增加原始細節。白底由閱讀頁提供；展開可捲動查看，合起來回到緊湊寬度。</p></details><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:694px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.8051044083526682\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/b24ec5e35910263334da938eceb09fff5f93bd1e94f56d3a0219bc1ec9ba97a2.png\" alt=\"第46題官方附圖的既有放大擷取版，694×862像素；已與官方PDF的261×326原始嵌圖核對內容。解析度有限，勿單靠腔緣起伏排除輸出小管。\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"694\" height=\"862\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/b24ec5e35910263334da938eceb09fff5f93bd1e94f56d3a0219bc1ec9ba97a2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><p>考選部 113 年第一次醫學（一）原題 · 官方本卷原題圖的放大擷取版；未取得獨立圖像授權條款，不作獨立素材再利用。中文導讀另加。<a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">來源與原圖入口</a> · <a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">官方題卷（非獨立素材授權）</a></p></figure><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><strong>官方最終採計：A</strong></p><div><p>答案 A，依考選部最終採計。圖中可辨柱狀上皮與腔面纖毛樣細緣；輸卵管與輸出小管都可能具纖毛，這張低解析單圖不足以只靠腔緣起伏排除 C。</p></div><div><p>判圖時先辨認上皮型態，再區分整個黏膜的皺襞與上皮細胞本身高低交替。本圖腔緣起伏明顯，但解析度與視野有限，無法可靠確認每個突起是否含固有層核心，因此不把它當作排除輸出小管的決定證據。本題作答仍依官方最終採計 A。</p><p>輸卵管典型為單層柱狀上皮，含纖毛細胞及分泌細胞，並形成含固有層的黏膜皺襞。輸出小管也有纖毛細胞與吸收細胞，常因細胞高低交替呈波浪狀腔緣。因此，「有纖毛」或「腔緣不平」都不能單獨作為兩者的鑑別依據。</p><h3>選項怎麼分</h3><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><caption>選項解析</caption><thead><tr><th>選項</th><th>解釋</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><span>選項</span>A</th><td><span>解釋</span>輸卵管典型為含纖毛與分泌細胞的單層柱狀上皮；本題官方採 A。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>B</th><td><span>解釋</span>陰道正常是非角化複層扁平上皮，與高柱狀纖毛圖像不同。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>C</th><td><span>解釋</span>輸出小管也有纖毛細胞與吸收細胞，常見高低交替及波浪狀腔緣；單靠本圖不能可靠排除，需和黏膜皺襞及完整組織架構合看。</td></tr><tr><th><span>選項</span>D</th><td><span>解釋</span>尿道上皮因段落改變，不能只寫一種；尿道不是以典型的單層纖毛柱狀上皮為辨認特徵。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><h3>一起記的概念</h3><p>副睪管的 stereocilia（靜纖毛）是長微絨毛，以肌動蛋白為骨架，主要吸收；輸出小管與輸卵管的可動纖毛則為微管骨架。術語包含 cilia 不保證都是會擺動的同一種結構。</p></div><details><summary>官方採計與組織對照</summary><p><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部最終更正答案</a>：Q46 仍為 A。組織特徵對照：<a href=\"https://medcell.org/histology/male_reproductive_system_lab/ductuli_efferentes.php\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yale MedCell：輸出小管</a>；<a href=\"https://histology.leeds.ac.uk/home/female/fallop_tube/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Leeds：輸卵管</a>。答案採計與單張影像可支持的推論分開處理。</p></details><div><h3>另看清楚的對照切片：皺襞層次與細胞腔緣</h3><p>以下為獨立教學對照圖。先用低倍辨認整體黏膜，再用較高倍率看表面細胞；原題附圖的解析限制與官方採計仍按上文保留。</p><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1536px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0741258741258741\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/2b4cf9f54a6e8308b78fdb0861b5eaad5b9b9f76997adc37e7c370137f895089.jpg\" alt=\"獨立教學圖：正常人類輸卵管的複雜黏膜皺摺\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1430\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/2b4cf9f54a6e8308b78fdb0861b5eaad5b9b9f76997adc37e7c370137f895089.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>輸卵管低倍：多分支黏膜皺襞伸入管腔，外圍有較厚的肌層。 圖：Ed Uthman, M.D.，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 2.0</a>；<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Normal_Fallopian_Tube%2C_Human.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1219px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5568326947637292\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ccb366ec358d54f08251df655fcd39597302ae4d72952fc5d6535d38855e16c6.jpg\" alt=\"獨立教學圖：輸卵管腔面的纖毛柱狀細胞\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1219\" height=\"783\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/ccb366ec358d54f08251df655fcd39597302ae4d72952fc5d6535d38855e16c6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>輸卵管上皮高倍：柱狀細胞覆蓋表面，部分腔面可見纖毛緣。 圖：Mikael Häggström, M.D.，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0</a>；<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Histology_of_ciliated_columnar_epithelium_of_the_fallopian_tube.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure></div></div><p>左圖先選一條較寬的皺襞，沿深紫色上皮包覆的邊緣往內看：中間還有<strong>粉紅色結締組織核心</strong>，所以是整層黏膜一起向腔內折入。右圖則把視野縮到上皮，腔面在上、固有層在下；這個倍率用來辨柱狀細胞及纖毛緣，不能再拿它代表整條輸卵管的皺襞分布。</p><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:990px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.462686567164179\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/c77b07a7ffa91554b6547c429850a435ca7176cbf99bacf0916e539eb2bb21ca.jpg\" alt=\"獨立教學圖：輸出小管的波浪狀管腔與副睪管對照\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"990\" height=\"402\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/c77b07a7ffa91554b6547c429850a435ca7176cbf99bacf0916e539eb2bb21ca.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>輸出小管與鄰近副睪管：原作者完整照片及線描雙面板。Ductule efferentes標示輸出小管，Epididymus指向較規整的鄰近副睪管。 圖：Robert B. Tallitsch；Ronald Guastaferri（原教材繪圖／美術協調），<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://pressbooks.pub/rbtallitsch/chapter/chapter-14-male-reproductive-system/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。</figcaption></figure><p>下圖右側<strong>輸出小管</strong>的內緣起伏不平，對照左側實際切片，就能看到波浪狀腔緣。這種高低交替與輸卵管「含固有層核心的黏膜皺襞」是不同層次的觀察；個別細胞纖毛、吸收細胞及皺襞核心仍需足夠倍率和完整視野確認。兩者都可能有纖毛，因此<strong>有纖毛不等於能單獨排除輸出小管</strong>，也不能用這些清楚對照圖替原題補出看不見的細節。</p><details><summary>對照圖來源與授權</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Normal_Fallopian_Tube%2C_Human.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">獨立教學圖：正常人類輸卵管的複雜黏膜皺摺</a>；CC BY-SA 2.0</li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Histology_of_ciliated_columnar_epithelium_of_the_fallopian_tube.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">獨立教學圖：輸卵管腔面的纖毛柱狀細胞</a>；CC0 1.0</li><li><a href=\"https://pressbooks.pub/rbtallitsch/chapter/chapter-14-male-reproductive-system/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">獨立教學圖：輸出小管的波浪狀管腔與副睪管對照</a>；CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</li></ul></details></div></div>","imageCount":4,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：A"}